# Android release signing.
#
# A keystore whose password is lost cannot be replaced: Android identifies an update
# by its signing key, so losing this file means unpublishing the app and starting
# again rather than shipping the next version. It is also the single file in this
# repository that would let anyone publish an update to Ilm.
#
# The *fingerprint* in assetlinks.json is derived from it and is public — Android
# has to serve it to verify the link — so that belongs in git and this does not.
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
android/app/*.jks
